{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "35612162231761847", "organization": {"id": "143292931875082", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "35612162231761847"}]}, "id": "1290988049849886"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "35612162231761847", "release_date": 1779987240, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "36280435048267892"}, "id": "3016977871841135"}]}}, "binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "35612162231761847", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "36280435048267892"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "id": "36280435048267892", "version": "1.1", "version_code": 2, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1781536791, "id": "36280526388258758", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v3", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 3, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "36282184691426261"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "35612162231761847"}, "id": "36282184691426261", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "35612162231761847", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1180013304210755"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Sin t\u00edtulo-3_grande.png", "id": "1876635376337167", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1876635379670500_4308229000641340391_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mglwrsBNuPoQ7kNvwHeaKpd&_nc_oc=Adp0pVPWQYCQVJxHnNt7UYN5pm_8AtSbuvmlGuix9N31UTejOFF1bXz0pFL3b2gIAzY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8GYicn9jOFI_6lUUJ0r5PodeuE1h4ImD-jy11kxu5CsQ&oe=6A3AB28A"}, {"file_name": "ImagenPost.png", "id": "1709326093438054", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_1709326096771387_7230375159379753215_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sI924t6-Ji4Q7kNvwHtFu3N&_nc_oc=Ado_iYEIizOI5Z9_pTotPHrEDLfOWx4kO-zFiVimPYDJCYdj2j6Uj80_5Z93puLB4IU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8pg7wefzp6Q5Ze8XMqyRDOuOGiyQhAaRdAGyNn8HfVOQ&oe=6A3A8639"}, {"file_name": "Imagen3.png", "id": "1556788282772082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828050_1556788286105415_4984410497413346481_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N6rzNGu3S94Q7kNvwFq5UpH&_nc_oc=AdreRm8rkUby0l8dT9G-my8ooF2g6R5EphSbmEa_Lt4NYaQuqJKELSM-noKGEzfwKig&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_WeFXVQy-s_ZGia6Z_Kw9iBX-KLOHCbWrzGI6RGkUKPg&oe=6A3A86F8"}]}, "id": "1718843566057344", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Escape the Urban Underground.", "keywords": ["SalaDeEscape", "EscapeRoom", "ScapeRoom", "Misterio", "AcertijosYPuzzles"], "long_description": "**Bienvenido a las sombras**\n\nTe ofrecemos una experiencia de escape room terror\u00edfica y altamente inmersiva que llevar\u00e1 tu mente al l\u00edmite. En las profundidades de la bulliciosa ciudad se encuentra una estaci\u00f3n de metro olvidada, aislada del mundo durante d\u00e9cadas. Un espantoso asesinato acaba de tener lugar en estos andenes en ruinas, pero pronto te das cuenta de que no est\u00e1s solo.\n\n{1876635376337167}\n\n\n**El desaf\u00edo de una sola sesi\u00f3n**\n\nEste es un reto de escape puro y duro que pondr\u00e1 a prueba tus nervios. Dise\u00f1ado para completarse en una sola e intensa partida con un tiempo m\u00e1ximo de 60 minutos (aunque los jugadores que ya han disfrutado de la experiencia completa han tardado entre 120 y 240 minutos en superarlo tras varios intentos), este juego no tiene puntos de guardado ni checkpoints de ning\u00fan tipo. Una vez que entras en la estaci\u00f3n, el reloj empieza a correr. Debes conectar las pistas, resolver el asesinato y encontrar la salida en un \u00fanico intento que te dejar\u00e1 sin aliento.\n\n{1709326093438054}\n\n\n**Puzles din\u00e1micos y preparados para VR**\n\nInteract\u00faa de cerca con un entorno espeluznante creado exclusivamente para la realidad virtual. Tendr\u00e1s que investigar la escena con cuidado, restaurar la energ\u00eda de oxidados terminales de tr\u00e1nsito, hackear cr\u00edpticos paneles de seguridad geom\u00e9tricos y abrirte paso a trav\u00e9s de vagones de tren claustrof\u00f3bicos y llenos de escombros. Cada puzle requiere l\u00f3gica pr\u00e1ctica, una gran capacidad de observaci\u00f3n y pensar r\u00e1pido.\n\n{1556788282772082}", "short_description": "Ad\u00e9ntrate en la oscuridad de Escape the Urban Underground, un tenso escape room ambientado en una estaci\u00f3n de metro abandonada. Acaba de ocurrir un espantoso asesinato y hay extra\u00f1as fuerzas paranormales en juego. Tienes 60 minutos para resolver complejos puzles y descubrir la verdad. Cuidado: no hay puntos de guardado. Debes sobrevivir, resolver el misterio y escapar en una \u00fanica e intensa partida que te pondr\u00e1 el coraz\u00f3n a mil. Atr\u00e9vete a entrar en el subsuelo."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ImagenPost.png", "id": "2333586823832845", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310734_2333586830499511_4281950547705139550_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ogP9MEh8M2UQ7kNvwFO54Tf&_nc_oc=AdpZ7nnVohmZRn73nPGtqYVsq8DGhKyQfN91dXvb5O1rtB-GfQE43gmFeB9LBToMbcE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_TI_8h9IQfQUHt6O4QDOXLfbLwsu0jlG2IAsz35XEQAw&oe=6A3AA17D"}, {"file_name": "ImagenDefinitiva.png", "id": "2104653746929479", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307962_2104653750262812_2060952355117404750_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R0cUA6cH4MkQ7kNvwGf5b_l&_nc_oc=AdoA7J8x1vHBUhgxbtvubsc5aWeu-hYTvdW4FbFfNM4NvMeNFbn45cFpx1YRvOrDTZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af95jeHw6SAheK7dQA7udCJVI6NHElGCcUtg_zG7QEUC4A&oe=6A3A8C79"}, {"file_name": "ImagenDefinitiva_small.png", "id": "1917531142242303", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507818746_1917531145575636_3010749571905173882_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EP6W4xXqhy8Q7kNvwFXvc4-&_nc_oc=Adpytuo6FXbI4BDMGoKugPh8EM-Ocpzr607x3oNRI6xbHWGDzhlm0BSkMBUXKb9flSo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-kADHFf7nrSZtGUTR8onpGqcKMSpGs4aG6oYF5GBeqOg&oe=6A3A965D"}, {"file_name": "Logotipo.png", "id": "1456485105790639", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_1456485109123972_8069026116082994295_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fs2iaQvE7f8Q7kNvwEm-bPe&_nc_oc=AdqFNYZdqMblkk_THJza_uuZdwlhQyFX5Uj_R0wMUnDrEP7-c82kO8FJ1TjBg9V-lc4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8BaUNgKXPnBHTzvJSInAb6yOuLnGvOFq0oGwH1rhXrxg&oe=6A3AB79D"}, {"file_name": "Imagen 2.png", "id": "1416594846894233", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_1416594850227566_6